Strength one. Since He's a dedicated crafter, this might get him to change his mind. Especially since you can't even attempt a feat of strength unless you have strength three.</li> </ul><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1067-primefactorx01","name":"Primefactorx01","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1067_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-04T19:21:24-08:00","id":823953,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primefactorx01</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/797631-why-craft-sucks-how-i-fixed-it?p=823690#post823690\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><ul><li>Looks like you have the same durations as Glorious Solar Saber/Armor. I'm actually considering an essence upgrade to GSS that gives it an indefinite duration (And explicitly state that it's a valid target for weapon summoning) so that it can actually be someone's main weapon.</li> <li>I absolutely love the idea of making Shattering Grasp use strength. Anything to make the attribute more valuable. I happen to know someone who decided that he can live with Strength one. Since He's a dedicated crafter, this might get him to change his mind. Especially since you can't even attempt a feat of strength unless you have strength three.</li> </ul><br /></div> </div> </div> </div>stop trying to force me to take strength lol","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><d